{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id113717493"}, "name":{"label":"paze057"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-21T02:51:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.42"}, "id":{"label":"12568626440"}, "title":{"label":"confusing interface"}, "content":{"label":"i think the sound and quality is good and was helping me concentrate or have a power nap. but overall i feel like the interface is confusing. the whole animation which covers 80% of the screen is pointless in a soundscape app. i dont want to look on my screen. this is the point of the app right? then you have to click on explore to get to the focus timer which to me might be an essential feature for learning. it felt like there are the same functions in different locations. i dont know exactly because im no app designer but i would scrap the whole interface and make it more user friendly. its a pricy app and in that regard the interface is too confusing. \n\nfor example when i want to study i have like 20 different menu options which is overwelming. i rather use the free version just because its a lot simpler.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1346247457&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
